WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.126
Joe Biden just warned

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:02.460
Israel to be careful

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:02.836
as they

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.504
consider invading Gaza

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.339
in response to these Hamas attacks.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.173
You would think that Hamas

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.091
would be no match

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:10.176
for the much stronger Israeli military.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.678
But what Biden is referring to

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.096
is the lessons the U.S.

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.556
learned after 9/11,

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:15.932
when our very powerful military

00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:16.808
went to Afghanistan

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.476
and Iraq and spent decades

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:19.853
mired in warfare

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:22.105
with much less powerful fighters,

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:24.065
but crucially, fighting in cities.

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:26.026
This thing that is much more difficult

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.485
than any other kind of warfare.

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:28.153
Military analysts

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:29.237
told the Financial Times

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:30.447
that if Israeli soldiers

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:31.614
invade Gaza

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:32.574
they’re likely to find that

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.908
fighters are actually dressed

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:34.659
as civilians,

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:36.995
that weapons might be stored in mosques,

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.121
that houses will be rigged

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.289
with explosives.

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:40.290
And that there will be military

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.208
facilities under schools.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.918
This will make it very difficult

00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:45.211
to fight with militants

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.171
without inflicting

00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:47.881
major harm on civilians.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:48.381
The U.S.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:51.009
got sucked into decades of endless,

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.635
unproductive urban warfare,

00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:54.763
and they're warning Israel to be careful

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.556
as they consider their invasion strategy.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:57.807
I’m going to be following this war

00:00:57.807 --> 00:00:59.100
to try to understand it, if you want to

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.018
follow along for more.

